appings without a tracking store.\n- If coupling exists, produce a concrete refactor plan that factors workspace resolution\n  into an independent initialization path within the plugin, preserving the existing\n  behavior for the tracking server's non-artifact operations.\n- Deliver a findings document with a definitive coupled / not-coupled answer and, if\n  coupled, the refactor plan that the plugin extension work will execute.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- A findings document states definitively whether the plugin's workspace resolution\n  functions with tracking and model registry stores uninitialized, citing the specific\n  initialization code paths examined.\n- If coupled: the refactor plan lists each coupling point and the proposed independent\n  initialization path, sufficient for the plugin extension work to be scoped and\n  estimated.\n- If not coupled: the answer is demonstrated by exercising workspace resolution in an\n  artifacts-only-style context (stores uninitialized) with a pass/fail result recorded.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-7 (auth plugin workspace resolution in the artifacts-only context): this\n  investigation determines that requirement's implementation scope.\n- Enables HLR-1, HLR-2, HLR-3: the server-side workspace validation depends on plugin\n  resolution functioning store-free.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":80334,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bc9990585c0fc227","agent_id":"a9ee74de494750547","session_id":"40ac0a95-f7b4-4f3c-bf55-b2c4e97b3f62","uuid":"fffee295-6233-4477-8bc1-83897847cd0c","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:21:55.814Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8009"}
